8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,750
Ten stock photos.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,550
None of them is the number Tamir asked for.

10
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:50,950
Is the calculator the budget?
No. The calculator is expenses.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,550
Exhibit C: the navigation bar.

12
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:01,350
Time-logs. My Time-logs.
Due Dates. Subtasks.

13
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:05,950
Ten tabs.
Each a little different from the last.

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,750
Exhibit D: the Work Orders Dashboard.

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,550
The answer is right there.

16
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:21,350
“Time Spent – (122…”
Cut off. Mid-number.

17
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:25,550
To read the rest, scroll sideways.
Like the Dead Sea Scrolls.

18
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,950
Details: “No items selected.”
Relatable.

19
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,350
Inon, how long does it take to find one number?

20
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:38,750
It’s fine.I’ve made peace with it.

21
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:42,950
(Suspiciously calm.)

22
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:48,750
Exhibit E: the Today Menu.

23
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,750
Three buttons.
Each the size of a pizza.

24
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,950
Forgot to press Start this morning?
Edit your Report. Then find your report.

25
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,750
