30
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,750
ADD PARENT DOC. ADD CHILD DOC.

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,950
Documents have parents now.
Nobody told the documents.

32
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:41,550
Clicks: 38. Time spent: 11 minutes. Apps opened: 2. Answer found: no.

33
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:47,950
ANSWER EXPECTED: NEXT MONTH

34
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,350
Inon?

35
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:53,550
Still fine.

36
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:57,950
(Still suspiciously calm.)

37
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:05,950
There is a better way. The GALIL Employee Portal.

38
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:12,350
Same question.
In the Employee Portal.

39
